    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, A. Ibathul Rauff Hakeem,the Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, having obtained a report under Section 70C of theaforesaid Act, in respect of the Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (Guarantee) Limited, a company incorporatedin Sri Lanka under the Companies Act, No. 7 of 2007 and bearing registration Number GL 24, do by this Order, amend theSchedule II to the Order made under the said Act, and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2067/16 of April 19, 2018by the addition immediately after the entry \u201cBachelor of Education Honours in English\u201d appearing in Column I and itscorresponding entry in Column II thereof, of the entries specified under Column I and Column II respectively of theSchedule II hereto, subject to the conditions specified in Schedule I hereto :-",
